# Single modern build: webOS 22 and newer. The webOS 1-6 entries (safari 7/8,
# chrome 38/53/68/79) were dropped along with the legacy build -- leaving them
# here silently pinned webpack's own runtime to a Safari 7 feature set, because
# `target: 'browserslist:<query>'` resolves this file before it ever treats the
# string as a query.
#
# The oldest entry is what governs feature detection; the rest are documentation.
chrome 87 # webOS 7 (22)
chrome 94 # webOS 8 (23)
chrome 108 # webOS 9 (24)
